    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11062" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀξιο-στράτηγος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ρᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>worthy of being
				general</i> or <i>worthy of a great commander,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				3.1.24
			</span></i>(
				Comp.
			), <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				36.24
			</span></i> codd. (
				Sup.
			):— <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀξιο-στρᾰτηγικός</span></b>  is found as v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.11.9
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				41.55
			</span></i>, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀξιο-στρᾰτήγητος</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				45.42
			</span></i>.</div>
